{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013980/extras/5e31fffa569a2b324291e75254d0ebf0.poster.avif?t=1759851253\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013980/extras/5e31fffa569a2b324291e75254d0ebf0.webm?t=1759851253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tribute Games and Dotemu are teaming up again, in collaboration with Marvel Games, to craft an original, fresh beat 'em up. Featuring dynamic combat combos and dazzling pixel art, this planet-hopping adventure stands as a love letter to the Marvel Universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013980/extras/17222880e6d5a7ba11df39bd0693b985.avif?t=1759851253\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So swears Annihilus, the living death that walks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unprecedented attack is launched across the galaxy, all life hangs in the balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Cosmic Swap tag-team system, choose two heroes for each level and switch between them instantly. Create unique combos and powerful special attacks. Each character\u2019s abilities encourage creative team-ups and a more tactical approach to the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013980/extras/f8e21f0b5aa34c65b554a54d6638e143.poster.avif?t=1759851253\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013980/extras/f8e21f0b5aa34c65b554a54d6638e143.webm?t=1759851253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013980/extras/f8e21f0b5aa34c65b554a54d6638e143.mp4?t=1759851253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 playable heroes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nova, Spider-Man, Wolverine, Phyla-Vell, Captain America, Storm, Venom, She-Hulk and Rocket Raccoon: you\u2019ll find familiar faces and discover new favorites in a captivating roster of characters from across the Marvel Universe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 playable levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore New York City and Helicarrier while facing the hordes under Annihilus\u2019 command.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer for everyone</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're enjoying this demo solo or teaming up with friends and family, it has you covered with local/online play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013980/extras/699bd7bbc4291e8dbd7c781c32ab33af.poster.avif?t=1759851253\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013980/extras/699bd7bbc4291e8dbd7c781c32ab33af.webm?t=1759851253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013980/extras/699bd7bbc4291e8dbd7c781c32ab33af.mp4?t=1759851253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cosmic battle awaits!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepag